C14AE0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Luna EP1 Cover Landscape.png", "id": "2120245951456670", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974493_2120245954790003_5966831534778103198_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iWgKRWMKJjEQ7kNvwGCjGgH&_nc_oc=Ado-AFwLZBM6YE7aD0P2S-DnrLDKaC20QJQMX8sqBacyfEDghQaalNyC6VLVRlgmuhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwEQm6wMPkLa-rUgOXiGC5OvxaudLER-6dU4gDCvVqy0g&oe=69C15126"}, "display_name": "Luna: Episode 1 - Left Behind (DEMO)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "LUNA: EPISODE 1 - LEFT BEHIND is a 25-30 minute interactive VR story about an android and a little girl trying to survive an AI apocalypse. The machines seem to be after only one goal: to exterminate its creators. \n\u200b\nYou, a small commercial droid, wake up and find your system to be reset.\nCan you, a droid with no combat capabilities, protect Luna? Can humanity be saved?\n\nFeatures:\n- Talk to the characters. LUNA uses speech recognition to help you immerse in the story and connect with the characters. \n- Dialogue options will guide you through the story while letting you make meaningful decisions that impact the ending.\n- Prepare for an emotional ride. The story is full of heart-warming and uplifting moments.", "short_description": "LUNA: EPISODE 1 - LEFT BEHIND is a 25-30 minute interactive VR story about an android and a little girl trying to survive an AI apocalypse. The machines seem to be after only one goal: to exterminate its creators. \n\u200b\nYou, a small commercial droid, wake up and find your system to be reset.\nCan you, a droid with no combat capabilities, protect Luna? Can humanity be saved?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lunavrstory.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "N/A", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.lunavrstory.com/", "category